Prior work
----------

The `quditto` module takes its name and its inspiration from Quditto
(https://github.com/Networks-it-uc3m/Quditto), the platform for deploying
digital twins of QKD networks over classical infrastructure developed at
the Universidad Carlos III de Madrid (Networks-it-uc3m), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. The module here was written from scratch and shares no
code with that project; what it owes to it is the idea of a QKD node with
no quantum hardware behind a standard ETSI 014 API, and the name.

